        <Literal xml:lang="en">unstable condition arising during constant voltage charge in which the rate of heat dissipation capability, causing a continuous temperature increase with resulting further charge current increase, which can lead to the destruction of the battery</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
