        <IRI>http://emmo.info/electrochemistry#electrochemistry_057bb143_639c_472b_99ed_ffa1867f6e63</IRI>
        <Literal xml:lang="en">glassy carbon combines glass-like mechanical characteristics with physical properties similar to graphite, owing to its “graphene ribbon” structure</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
