        <IRI>http://emmo.info/electrochemistry#electrochemistry_2fd5964b_0c65_4413_8b8c_849639e6d1e7</IRI>
        <Literal xml:lang="en">an electrode with blended silicon oxide and graphite active materials</Literal>
