        <Literal xml:lang="en">Coulometry used to measure the amount of substance is a primary reference measurement procedure [VIM 2.8] not requiring calibration with a standard for a quantity of the same kind (i.e. amount of substance).</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
