        <IRI>http://emmo.info/electrochemistry#electrochemistry_9da958fc_f76d_4654_8a78_99b5f98c118c</IRI>
        <Literal xml:lang="en">a system comprising one electrode in contact with an ionic conductor.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
