        <IRI>http://emmo.info/electrochemistry#electrochemistry_a462859d_d8bd_48ea_8bde_1576f1248a1e</IRI>
        <Literal xml:lang="en">Ag electrodes were first used in potentiometry for the determination of Cl−, Br−, I−, as well as for Ag+ ions, to which they are sensitive.</Literal>
