        <Literal xml:lang="en">A &apos;Semiosis&apos; that involves an &apos;Observer&apos; that perceives another &apos;Physical&apos; (the &apos;Object&apos;) through a specific perception mechanism and produces a &apos;Property&apos; (the &apos;Sign&apos;) that stands for the result of that particular perception according to a well defined conventional procedure.</Literal>
