        <IRI>http://emmo.info/emmo#EMMO_22522299_4091_4d1f_82a2_3890492df6db</IRI>
        <Literal xml:lang="en">An experiment is a process that is intended to replicate a physical phenomenon in a controlled environment.</Literal>
