        <Literal xml:lang="en">Arrays are ordered mathematical objects who&apos;s elementary spatial parts are numbers. Their dimensionality is constructed with spatial direct parthood, where 1-dimensional arrays have spatial direct parts Number and n-dimensional array have spatial direct parts (n-1)-dimensional arrays.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
