        <Literal xml:lang="en">A Vector is a 1-dimensional Array with Number as spatial direct parts,
a Matrix is a 2-dimensional Array with Vector as spatial direct parts,
an Array3D is a 3-dimensional Array with Matrix as spatial direct parts,
and so forth...</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:comment"/>
