        <IRI>http://emmo.info/emmo#EMMO_ae2d1a96_bfa1_409a_a7d2_03d69e8a125a</IRI>
        <Literal xml:lang="en">Participation is a parthood relation: you must be part of the process to contribute to it. A participant whose 4D extension is totally contained within the process.

Participation is not under direct parthood since a process is not strictly related to reductionism, but it&apos;s a way to categorize temporal regions by the interpreters.</Literal>
