        <Literal xml:lang="en">A physical constant relating energy at the individual particle level with temperature. It is the gas constant R divided by the Avogadro constant.

It defines the Kelvin unit in the SI system.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
