        <IRI>http://emmo.info/emmo#MetrePerMinute</IRI>
        <Literal xml:lang="en">Meter Per Minute (m/min) is a unit in the category of Velocity. It is also known as meter/minute, meters per minute, metre per minute, metres per minute. Meter Per Minute (m/min) has a dimension of LT-1 where L is length, and T is time. It can be converted to the corresponding standard SI unit m/s by multiplying its value by a factor of 0.016666666666

-- QUDT</Literal>
