        <IRI>http://emmo.info/emmo#PascalSecondPerMetre</IRI>
        <Literal xml:lang="en">Pascal Second Per Meter (Pa-s/m) is a unit in the category of Specific acoustic impedance. It is also known as pascal-second/meter. Pascal Second Per Meter has a dimension of ML²T⁻¹ where M is mass, L is length, and T is time. It essentially the same as the corresponding standard SI unit kg/m2· s.

-- QUDT</Literal>
