        <IRI>http://emmo.info/emmo#VoltPerSecond</IRI>
        <Literal xml:lang="en">&apos;Volt per Second&apos; is a unit of magnetic flux equaling one weber. This is the flux passing through a conducting loop and reduced to zero at a uniform rate in one second inducing an electric potential of one volt in the loop.

-- QUDT</Literal>
